    {
      "text": "快节奏技巧决斗与大规模枪战使用西部时代枪械展开",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Engage in fast-paced, skill-based duels and large-scale shootouts using authentic Western firearms. Every bullet counts when lawlessness rules the land.",
