      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "开放西部包含峡谷、匪徒藏身处、鬼镇与定居点，地点承载秘密和任务",
      "dimension": "题材",
      "excerpt": "Explore rugged canyons, outlaw hideouts, ghost towns, and frontier settlements across a vast 3D environment powered by modern Unity technology. Every location holds secrets, quests, and choices that shape your legacy.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/4147110/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "帮助定居者或加入匪帮会改变英雄、亡命徒与救赎路线及阵营声望",
      "dimension": "故事",
      "excerpt": "Ride across the badlands, defend settlers, hunt bandits, or join them. Your decisions write your legend—hero, outlaw, or something in between. 🏜️ Dynamic Reputation & Faction System Every action has consequence. Earn fame, infamy, or redemption as townsfolk react to your deeds and alliances.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/4147110/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
